        "summary":  "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore now offers temporal policies and gateway rate limiting to give enterprises control over AI agent behavior and spending across multi-step workflows. Temporal policies evaluate sequences of agent actions rather than individual requests in isolation, catching cumulative risks that stateless rules miss. Rate limiting caps token consumption and request volume, directly addressing the cost unpredictability that has been a barrier to autonomous agent adoption in enterprise settings.",
